WEBVTT

00:00:28.765 --> 00:00:30.841
Popila je nekaj napitka,

00:00:30.841 --> 00:00:32.675
a ko so ji v kozarec

00:00:32.675 --> 00:00:34.071
dolili preostalo pivo,

00:00:34.071 --> 00:00:36.524
je na površje splaval

00:00:36.524 --> 00:00:39.106
razpadajoč polž.

00:00:39.106 --> 00:00:40.650
Čez tri dni so jo sprejeli

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.156
v bolnišnico v Glasgowu

00:00:42.156 --> 00:00:44.214
in ugotovili, da ima resen gastroenteritis

00:00:44.214 --> 00:00:46.167
ter da je v šoku.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:49.435
Primer Donoghue proti Stevensonu,
ki je sledil,

00:00:49.435 --> 00:00:52.080
je postavil pomemben pravni precedens:

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.811
Proizvajalec ingverjevega piva Stevenson

00:00:53.811 --> 00:00:56.588
je imel jasno dolžnost skrbnega ravnanja

00:00:56.588 --> 00:00:58.036
do May Donoghue,

00:00:58.036 --> 00:01:00.138
čeprav med njima ni bilo pogodbe